        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1410-626, Oversize Wall Bumper</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis extra large 3-7/8\" diameter wall bumper is made of solid cast brass and is super sturdy. Being oversized helps spread the load across a larger area of the wall helping to prevent damage. It can also be used to hide existing wall damage.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1410-626_size.gif?v=1704354730\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1410-626 Oversize Wall Bumper size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with all installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1410-626 Oversize Wall Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Color: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: (1) ea. 1/4-20 x 1-1/4\" Machine Screw, (3) ea. #8-32 x 1/4\" Machine Screw, (1) ea. Lead Expansion Shield</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1410-626.pdf?v=1704262330\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1410-626 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
